- glm: [low] The log is opened 'a+' and read via f.seek(0), but the record is written while the lock is held and flushed; however, if the process crashes between send() succeeding and f.write, the alarm was sent but never logged, so a retry would send a second Telegram message for the same issue even though the ruling says at most one per issue — the log, not Telegram, is the source of truth. Inherent to the design, not a ruling breach.


